Greyhound is a war, action, drama film directed by Aaron Schneider.

3
00:12:32,727 --> 00:12:38,727
A first-time captain leads a convoy of allied ships carrying thousands of soldiers
across the treacherous waters of the "Black Pit" to the front lines of WWII.

4
